  "details": "Not sure what people would think about this idea, but maybe we could optimize textures of avatars based on the user limit of the world or user count in the instance. \n\nBased on World User Limit:\n\nFor example if the world has a limit of 80 people, locally, optimize all textures that I render to X resolution or lower them down to 50%. If the limit is 40 users, make them X resolution or at 75%, etc.\n\nBased on Instance User Count:\n\nSame thing as above, but reduce the resolution as user count increases.\n\nIf I come up with other related ideas, I will put them in the comments.",
